https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I searched and did not find anything like this so hopefully not a duplicate.  First GH Copilot Agent is an absolute blast. Thank you all for letting me quickly get back to my love of building.   Here's where there is huge opportunity I think to add to the Agent.  \nWhile building a pretty simple web solution, the GH Copilot agent would recommend several possible next steps which is great.  For example :\n\"Next steps you might consider:\n\nAdd analytics or monitoring (e.g., Azure Application Insights, Google Analytics).\nSet up Entra (Azure AD) authentication for protected subpages, as discussed earlier.\nExpand your Playwright test coverage for accessibility and responsiveness.\nOptimize SEO with meta tags and Open Graph data.\nIf you need help with any of these or want to move forward with Entra-protected pages, just let me know!\"\n\nWhen I get this type of list of suggestions for next steps I want to place a bookmark/anchor so I can come back to the list once I am done with one of the items I have chosen. For example, in the list above I prioritized adding in telemetry and unfortunately some of the instructions were not quite right so by the time I finished I had to scroll back up to revisit this list of possible next steps.  While I know I could probably ask Copilot for possible next steps, it could be totally different.  It would be nice to be able to anchor these suggestions as vNext ideas which I could capture along the way and then quickly review. ","closed_by":{"login":"isidorn","id":1926584,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjY1ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1926584?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn","html_url":"https://github.com/isidorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/isidorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/13273/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/13273/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2999412892","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/13273#issuecomment-2999412892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/13273","id":2999412892,"node_id":"IC_